# XP and TDD

Use .ai/skills/xp-tdd-practices as the complete reference.

Cycle:

1. REASON: list examples from simplest to complex.
2. RED: write one failing test.
3. GREEN: implement the smallest code that passes.
4. REFACTOR: improve without behavior changes.
5. RE-EVALUATE: mark the case and choose the next one.

Apply TPP in GREEN. Commit on green, commit refactors separately, and never commit on red.
